WEBVTT

00:06:58.996 --> 00:07:00.916
by the war in Ukraine,

00:07:00.916 --> 00:07:04.836
then the food chain
for hundreds of millions of people

00:07:04.876 --> 00:07:06.396
might have snapped.

00:07:07.036 --> 00:07:12.516
The reason why hunger is rising
seems to be that,

00:07:12.556 --> 00:07:16.036
as the food system
has lost its resilience,

00:07:16.076 --> 00:07:20.516
more and more contagious shocks
are being transmitted across it.

00:07:21.156 --> 00:07:22.716
Now, we in the rich nations,

00:07:22.756 --> 00:07:27.796
we scarcely noticed the shocks
being caused by speculative surges

00:07:27.796 --> 00:07:31.716
and export bans and bottlenecking
and other issues like that,